{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119580/extras/95b4ca063b92e349544611c866043b72.avif?t=1764855389\" width=600 height=169 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;All game updates will be free and without the need for DLCs. All updates, seasons, and events will be free.&quot;</strong><br><br>The kingdom of Aetherion is devastated. Its villages are empty, leaving only magical creatures that dominate the lands and regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119580/extras/301fb4be5010e6fda0a493c1c227aa4b.avif?t=1764855389\" width=902 height=278 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With few remnants of civilization remaining, the kingdom now depends solely on you in this Beautiful and Gigantic world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119580/extras/211598af20231d62e08142afd54c9117.avif?t=1764855389\" width=902 height=278 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Current Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open World Survival Game for many to explore and survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through a landscape with diverse and unique biomes, and hot and cold climates such as lava and snow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight all kinds of creatures and zone bosses and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bags you need to manage and maintain. Also suitable for portable storage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find many types of weapons, and clothes and different types of equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make safe zones and places to take shelter.</p></li><li><p 